# CMS student portal (canonical rule extract)

Full instructions: `docs/ai/frontend/student-portal/AGENTS.md` and campus `docs/ai/AGENTS.md`.

Vite + React + TypeScript + Tailwind + shadcn/ui. Dark theme.

- Treat server data as coming from one Portal API. Prefer HTTP adapter when `VITE_PORTAL_API_URL` is set; otherwise mock.
- Do not write directly to the CMS or Postgres from the portal web.
- Style with existing tokens and documented type utilities.
- Chat lives in the Community column of the floating sidebar. Do not promote it to its own route or page.
- Product rules for Community/Chat: `docs/ai/frontend/student-portal/sidebar-behavior.md`.
- Demo is not Live.
